# --- Virtual Machine Caches & State Files ---
# Ignores temporary VMware files if you accidentally save files inside your VM shared folders
*.log
*.lck
*.vmem
*.vmdk
*.vmsd
*.vmx
*.vmxf

# --- OS Metadata Caches ---
# Ignores background files created by Windows/Mac file explorers
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# --- Office Document Temp Files ---
# Ignores hidden lock files created when you have your report open in Microsoft Word
~$*.docx
~$*.doc
